# Security and privacy headers for the static pages.
#
# Cloudflare Pages applies these to ASSET responses only. The Functions set their
# own headers in code (NO_STORE_HEADERS in src/lib/session.ts), because a Function
# response never passes through this file.
#
# WHY A CSP ON A PAGE WITH NO THIRD-PARTY ANYTHING
# -------------------------------------------------
# A privacy review found the workspace was loading each participant's avatar from
# avatars.githubusercontent.com, which handed GitHub their IP address and this
# origin as a Referer on every single page view. That image is gone and the pages
# now have zero third-party requests — but "we removed it" is a fact about today,
# and `default-src 'self'` is a fact about tomorrow. The CSP is what stops the
# next well-meaning edit from quietly reintroducing an external request.
#
# 'unsafe-inline' is present for style-src and script-src because the SIGN-IN
# page still inlines its CSS and JS — that is what keeps it self-contained with
# no CDN. The workspace page no longer does: its CSS, its shell script and the
# notebook renderer are same-origin files under /workspace/, already covered by
# `default-src 'self'`, and nothing had to be widened to allow them.
#
# So 'unsafe-inline' now exists for exactly one page. Moving public/index.html
# the same way would let it be dropped outright, which is the strictly better
# end state and needs no build step — only that page rewriting. Until then the
# protection comes from the code: every insertion of GitHub-supplied or
# notebook-supplied text goes through textContent, and notebook-view.js builds
# nodes rather than markup so there is no escaping step to get wrong.
#
# font-src is not listed and does not need to be: the webfonts are served from
# /fonts on this origin and fall through to `default-src 'self'`. A font from a
# CDN would need this file changed, which is the point.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
